    "problemDescription": "X-IG OSINT is an advanced Instagram OSINT toolkit that provides deep profile analysis, username scanning, account age checking, bot detection, shadowban detection, and breach lookup — all in a fast neon-themed cyber terminal interface.\n\n🟣🟢 X-IG OSINT — Advanced Instagram OSINT Framework\n\n\n\n                  X  I G   O S I N T   F R A M E W O R K\n\n\n---\n\n🔥 About X-IG OSINT\n\n🟣🟢 X-IG OSINT is a next-gen Instagram OSINT (Open-Source Intelligence) framework, designed for\nethical investigators, cybersecurity researchers, and analysts.\n\nIt includes 10 professional-grade modules, built with:\n✨ Purple–Green neon terminal theme\n✨ Smooth progress bars\n✨ Real data checks (no simulations)\n✨ Powerful automation\n✨ Fast API/UI hybrid logic\n\n\n---\n\n🚀 Features\n\n🟣 Core Instagram OSINT\n\n✔ Profile Info Lookup\n✔ Username Scanner\n✔ IG Ban / Unban Official Forms\n✔ Account Age Checker\n✔ Bot Followers Detector\n✔ Relationship Mapping\n✔ Shadowban Detector\n✔ Data Breach Lookup\n✔ Device Fingerprint OSINT\n✔ Location OSINT\n\n🟢 UI & UX\n\n✔ Purple/Green Neon Effects\n✔ Animated Spinners\n✔ ASCII Art Banner\n✔ Smooth Loading Bars\n✔ Clean Menu UI\n\n\n---\n\n🛡️ Badges\n\n    \n\n\n---\n\n📸 Screenshots\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n📥 Installation (Termux/Linux/macOS)\n\n1. Update packages\n```\npkg update && pkg upgrade -y\n```\n2. Install dependencies\n```\npkg install python git -y\npip install requests rich colorama\n```\n3. Clone the tool\n```\ngit clone https://github.com/hackerxphantom/X-IG-OSINT\ncd X-IG-OSINT\n```\n4. Requirements Install\n```\nbash install.sh\n```\n5. Run the tool\n```\npython X-IG-OSINT.py\n```\n\n---\n\n🧩 Menu Options\n\nChoose feature set (public-only, legal):\n1) Profile Info\n2) Username Scanner\n3) IG Ban/Unban Forms\n4) Account Age\n5) Data Breach Lookup\n6) Bot Followers Detect\n7) Relationship Mapping\n8) Shadowban Detector\n9) Device Fingerprint Check\n10) Location OSINT\n11) AI Fake Follower Detection (advanced)\n12) Engagement & Reel Analytics\n13) Sentiment on Comments\n14) Deep Footprint (100+ platforms)\n15) Username Monitor\n16) Hashtag OSINT\n17) Comment Intelligence\n18) AI Risk Score (aggregate)\n19) Story Highlights (limited public)\n20) IP Log Checker (user-provided export)\n21) Username History\n22) Reel analytics\n23) Face similarity helper (local)\n24) Raw HTML (dark/raw view)\n0) Exit\n\n---\n\n🟣🟢 Social Links\n\n🔥 YouTube\n\n👉 https://youtube.com/@hxphantom\nSubscribe before using the tool!\n\n💀 Instagram\n\n👉 https://instagram.com/hacker.xphantom\n\n\n---\n\n📚 Folder Structure\n\nX-IG-OSINT/\n│── xig.py\n│── README.md\n│── requirements.txt\n│── LICENSE\n│── /modules\n│     ├── profile_info.py\n│     ├── username_scan.py\n│     ├── age_checker.py\n│     ├── data_breach.py\n│     ├── relationship_map.py\n│     ├── bot_detector.py\n│     ├── shadowban_check.py\n│     ├── device_fingerprint.py\n│     └── location_osint.py\n|ETC.................\n\n\n---\n\n⚠️ Disclaimer\n\nThis project is only for:\n\n🔹 Educational OSINT Research\n🔹 Cybersecurity Learning\n🔹 Personal Investigation (legal)\n\n❌ No password cracking\n❌ No hacking\n❌ No illegal surveillance\n❌ No unauthorized access\n\nDeveloper is not responsible for any misuse.\n\n\n---\n\n❤️ Support\n\nIf you like this project, support by:\n\n⭐ Starring the GitHub Repo\n📢 Sharing the tool\n🔥 Subscribing on YouTube\n📷 Following on Instagram\n\n\n---\n\n🟣🟢 Made with Love by HX Phantom",
