        "content": "VM memakai register 32-bit. Beberapa opcode yang ditemukan:\n\n```text\nop 0  = input load\nop 1  = load constant\nop 2  = add/rotate mix\nop 3  = xor/rotate mix\nop 4  = multiply/add mix\nop 5  = xorshift-like mix\nop 6  = two-register mix\nop 7  = swap\nop 8  = checkpoint\nop 9  = rollback check\nop 10 = update MMR\nop 11 = success marker\nop 12 = swap\n```\n\nSetiap stage menghasilkan target register. Kalau input benar, hasil akhir register VM akan sama dengan target tersebut.\n\n---"
